{"code":"041910","name":"폴라리스AI파마","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 1999년 설립되어 2004년 코스닥에 상장했으며, 2024년 AI 및 소프트웨어 분야 기술력을 보유한 폴라리스그룹 계열사로 편입됨. 유기합성, 키랄기술, 나노필터기술 등을 통해 약 60종의 원료의약품을 생산하며, API와 CDMO 사업을 하고 있음. 국내외 100여 고객사를 통한 내수 및 해외 수출을 진행하며, 인허가가 까다로운 일본 시장 비중이 높음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-26","n_days":298,"close":5490.0,"open":5630.0,"high":5790.0,"low":5360.0,"volume":50723,"amount":278469270.0,"ret_1d":-1.6129,"gap":0.8961,"range_pct":7.8324,"ret_5":-4.3554,"ret_20":4.1746,"ret_60":3.0019,"ret_120":-21.1207,"ret_250":-16.944,"ma20":5635.0,"ma60":5453.8333,"ma120":5683.2917,"ma200":6141.475,"close_vs_ma200":-10.6078,"close_vs_ma60":0.6631,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":46.2253,"r2_60":0.3946,"slope_120":-32.2147,"r2_120":0.1869,"slope_250":-21.6291,"r2_250":0.2974,"high52":10200.0,"low52":4110.0,"pos_52w":22.6601,"dd_52w":-46.1765,"mdd_1y":-51.7937,"atr14_pct":5.9589,"vol_ann_60":44.188,"vol_avg20":39665.2,"vol_ratio20":1.2788,"vr5":0.552,"vr20":0.1084,"amount_avg5":231143662.0,"amount_avg20":224545374.0,"amount_avg60":350753619.5,"obv_chg20":9.375,"turnover_20":5.9722,"pv_eff_20":0.699,"rsi14":46.6835,"frgn_net_5":-17672.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.133,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.133,"frgn_net_20":29909.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.2252,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.2252,"frgn_net_60":52401.0,"inst_net_60":700.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.3945,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0053,"smart_net_60_pct":0.3998,"frgn_net_120":-66846.0,"inst_net_120":-2398.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.5032,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0181,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.5213,"foreign_ratio":1.71,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.41,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":8.0,"op_margin_q":5.4422,"op_qoq":33.3333,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-38.4615,"rev_yoy":6.5217,"op_trend_4q":-16.4706,"fin_period":"202606","roe":10.25,"debt_ratio":33.01,"per":5.17,"pbr":0.49,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate"